usage: benchmark_build.py [-h] [--configuration CONFIGURATION]
                          [--scons-arg SCONS_ARG] [--repetitions REPETITIONS]
                          [--source SOURCE] [--header HEADER]
                          [--output OUTPUT]

Compare development configurations in disposable source snapshots. Example:
python3 tools/benchmark_build.py --configuration normal:dev_fast=0
--configuration 'fast:dev_fast=1 linker=auto' --scons-arg target=web Reports
are local review evidence, never repository documentation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --configuration CONFIGURATION
                        LABEL:SCons options
  --scons-arg SCONS_ARG
  --repetitions REPETITIONS
  --source SOURCE
  --header HEADER
  --output OUTPUT
